            "content": "{\"original_question\":\"How can I find a more fulfilling way to express my love for music?\",\"task\":{\"question\":\"How can I find a more fulfilling way to express my love for music?\",\"output_slot\":\"response\",\"answer_type\":\"text\",\"inputs\":[\"music_history\",\"current_constraints\",\"goals\"],\"execution\":\"compose\"},\"request_context\":{\"query_identity\":\"32b731934ef636471447336c60a54d32bec4704f33094fb497f8b18c7d93af14\",\"algorithm_version\":\"dagbt_residual_memory_v2\",\"program_identity\":\"9f1ba853cd6e0e906aaab17b6ae008fb0e9633b2e64d4c76658274b7f23f23d5\",\"initial_dag_identity\":\"ebe16fc62762fbc36d68aff3114babb2e96faf4ed37adf65ab0c54b2a80c954c\"},\"variables\":{\"music_history\":{\"type\":\"text\",\"demand\":\"music_history\",\"open\":true,\"evidence_semantics\":\"personal_history_summary\",\"scope\":{\"entity_scope\":\"user\",\"time_scope\":\"past\"}},\"current_constraints\":{\"type\":\"text\",\"demand\":\"current_constraints\",\"open\":true,\"evidence_semantics\":\"personal_history_summary\",\"scope\":{\"entity_scope\":\"user\",\"time_scope\":\"current\"}},\"goals\":{\"type\":\"text\",\"demand\":\"goals\",\"open\":true,\"evidence_semantics\":\"personal_history_summary\",\"scope\":{\"entity_scope\":\"user\",\"time_scope\":\"current\"}},\"response\":{\"type\":\"text\",\"demand\":\"response\",\"scope\":{\"entity_scope\":\"user\",\"time_scope\":\"current\"}}},\"requested_slots\":[\"music_history\",\"current_constraints\",\"goals\",\"response\"],\"requested_scopes\":{\"music_history\":{\"entity_scope\":\"user\",\"time_scope\":\"past\"},\"current_constraints\":{\"entity_scope\":\"user\",\"time_scope\":\"current\"},\"goals\":{\"entity_scope\":\"user\",\"time_scope\":\"current\"},\"response\":{\"entity_scope\":\"user\",\"time_scope\":\"current\"}},\"output_contract\":{\"mode\":\"semantic\",\"result_type\":\"text\",\"entity_scope\":\"user\",\"time_scope\":\"current\",\"explanation\":\"semantic\"},\"program_revision\":0,\"rule_binding\":null,\"supported_parents\":{\"music_history\":{\"version\":1,\"source_ids\":[\"s22\",\"s23\",\"s11\",\"s12\",\"s31\",\"s46\",\"s13\",\"s4\",\"s3\",\"s33\",\"s47\",\"s32\",\"s14\",\"s10\",\"s35\",\"s43\",\"s34\",\"s45\",\"s44\"],\"demand\":\"music_history\",\"type\":\"text\",\"scope\":{\"entity_scope\":\"user\",\"time_scope\":\"past\"},\"value_ref\":\"t0\"},\"current_constraints\":{\"version\":1,\"source_ids\":[\"s22\",\"s23\",\"s11\",\"s12\",\"s46\",\"s13\",\"s4\",\"s3\",\"s55\",\"s47\",\"s14\",\"s10\",\"s43\",\"s56\",\"s45\",\"s44\"],\"demand\":\"current_constraints\",\"type\":\"text\",\"scope\":{\"entity_scope\":\"user\",\"time_scope\":\"current\"},\"value_ref\":\"t1\"},\"goals\":{\"version\":1,\"source_ids\":[\"s22\",\"s23\",\"s11\",\"s12\",\"s46\",\"s13\",\"s4\",\"s3\",\"s55\",\"s47\",\"s14\",\"s10\",\"s43\",\"s56\",\"s45\",\"s44\"],\"demand\":\"goals\",\"type\":\"text\",\"scope\":{\"entity_scope\":\"user\",\"time_scope\":\"current\"},\"value_ref\":\"t2\"}},\"known_observations\":[{\"id\":\"fact_ff7511c781a506a94559fa71\",\"stance\":\"support\",\"source_ids\":[\"s22\",\"s23\",\"s11\",\"s12\",\"s31\",\"s46\",\"s13\",\"s4\",\"s3\",\"s33\",\"s47\",\"s32\",\"s14\",\"s10\",\"s35\",\"s43\",\"s34\",\"s45\",\"s44\"],\"entity_scope\":\"user\",\"time_scope\":\"past\",\"parent_versions\":{},\"retract_ids\":[],\"reason\":\"The user explicitly describes past experiences: attending a 2017 electronic music festival (s31, s32), trying music theory in 2018 (s33, s34, s35), researching historical music trends in 2020 (s10, s11, s12), exploring audio production (s43, s44), creating own tracks (s45, s46, s47), enjoying live performances and album artwork/lyrics/stories (s13, s14), and finding a documentary unsatisfying (s22, s23, s47). The user also describes initial excitement about discovering new melodies (s3, s4) and a preference for emotional connection over technical analysis (s3, s4, s33, s34, s43, s44). No mention of playing an instrument or formal composing/performing.\",\"variable\":\"music_history\",\"revoked\":[],\"semantic_status\":\"model_judgment\",\"value_ref\":\"t0\"},{\"id\":\"fact_331ef7b8cae8b88cc518ac4b\",\"stance\":\"support\",\"source_ids\":[\"s22\",\"s23\",\"s11\",\"s12\",\"s46\",\"s13\",\"s4\",\"s3\",\"s55\",\"s47\",\"s14\",\"s10\",\"s43\",\"s56\",\"s45\",\"s44\"],\"entity_scope\":\"user\",\"time_scope\":\"current\",\"parent_versions\":{},\"retract_ids\":[],\"reason\":\"The user consistently describes a preference for emotional, personal, and creative engagement with music over technical or analytical approaches across multiple conversations. They explicitly state that music theory, historical research, and audio production felt tedious or overwhelming. They express enjoyment in exploring genres, cultural significance, lyrics, album artwork, and stories. They find deep fulfillment in creating their own music and attending live performances. Most recently, they describe connecting with their heritage through music as empowering. No time, resource, or social constraints are mentioned that would limit these preferred activities.\",\"variable\":\"current_constraints\",\"revoked\":[],\"semantic_status\":\"model_judgment\",\"value_ref\":\"t1\"},{\"id\":\"fact_081741079aba0f17cf301483\",\"stance\":\"support\",\"source_ids\":[\"s22\",\"s23\",\"s11\",\"s12\",\"s46\",\"s13\",\"s4\",\"s3\",\"s55\",\"s47\",\"s14\",\"s10\",\"s43\",\"s56\",\"s45\",\"s44\"],\"entity_scope\":\"user\",\"time_scope\":\"current\",\"parent_versions\":{},\"retract_ids\":[],\"reason\":\"The user explicitly states that creating their own tracks brings joy and satisfaction (s45, s46), that they are drawn to emotional aspects like storytelling and feelings (s44), and that they find fulfillment in exploring genres, live performances, and album artwork (s13, s14). They also express a desire to connect with their heritage through music (s55, s56). They reject technical dissection (s3, s43) and passive consumption (s22, s23, s47). These sources collectively support a summary of goals centered on personal creation, emotional connection, cultural exploration, and active engagement.\",\"variable\":\"goals\",\"revoked\":[],\"semantic_status\":\"model_judgment\",\"value_ref\":\"t2\"}],\"source_spans\":[[\"s3\",\"d1\",105,482,\"User: I just lost interest halfway through and felt it was taking away the joy I find in music. There was a time when the thrill of discovering new melodies brought so much happiness, but diving too deep into the technical aspects became more of a chore. It’s curious how something that once brought joy can evolve into a source of stress when we start dissecting it too much. \",\"user\",[24]],[\"s4\",\"d1\",482,767,\"I remember the initial excitement of exploring different genres, each bringing a fresh perspective, but I struggled with the framework of music theory. Ultimately, I recognized that the essence of my love for music lay in its emotional connection rather than its analytical components.\",\"user\",[24]],[\"s10\",\"d2\",105,393,\"User: It was something I tried in 2020, but researching historical music trends felt tedious and uninspiring. Despite my initial enthusiasm, diving into the vast amounts of literature, videos, and academic papers often felt overwhelming, almost like searching for a needle in a haystack. \",\"user\",[37,38]],[\"s11\",\"d2\",393,638,\"The more I tried to pinpoint what fascinated me, the more daunting it became, complicating the pursuit of enjoyable learning. Perhaps due to this overload of information, I lost sight of what initially drew me to the subject in the first place. \",\"user\",[37,38]],[\"s12\",\"d2\",638,828,\"It made me realize that sometimes a less structured approach to exploration could be more fulfilling, allowing for genuine interest to emerge rather than adhering strictly to a curriculum.\\n\\n\",\"user\",[37,38]],[\"s13\",\"d2\",828,1224,\"User: I realized that there are so many other ways for me to engage with music that align more with my interests, such as diving deeper into different genres or exploring the cultural significance behind various musical styles. Additionally, I've found that attending live performances, whether they are concerts or smaller gigs, allows me to truly feel the energy and connection with the music. \",\"user\",[37,38]],[\"s14\",\"d2\",1224,1624,\"Moreover, there's something special about discovering album artwork, lyrics, and the stories behind the songs that really captivates my curiosity. I've also considered making playlists that reflect different moods or themes, which can create a unique listening experience each time. The journey through music feels more personal and fulfilling when I can connect it to my own life story and emotions.\",\"user\",[37,38]],[\"s22\",\"d3\",105,478,\"User: I left feeling unsatisfied, as though the film skimmed over the intricacies that make music a universal language. It was almost as if they focused too much on celebrity interviews and not enough on the artistic process itself. I found myself reflecting on how music has the power to unite diverse cultures and express emotions that words alone often fail to capture. \",\"user\",[43]],[\"s23\",\"d3\",478,845,\"The disappointment lingered as I thought about the many documentaries that delve into the creative journeys of musicians, revealing not just their triumphs but also their struggles and failures. It made me realize that true connection with music often comes from a deeper engagement, one that can be achieved through personal creation rather than passive consumption.\",\"user\",[43]],[\"s31\",\"d4\",105,364,\"User: Yes, I attended another festival in 2017 that showcased electronic music, which was also eye-opening. The creativity displayed at that festival was nothing short of spectacular, with artists pushing the boundaries of sound in ways I had never imagined. \",\"user\",[21,22]],[\"s32\",\"d4\",364,655,\"There were vibrant visuals accompanying the music, and it felt like each performance was not just an auditory experience, but also a feast for the eyes. The diversity of electronic subgenres was a revelation; it really made me appreciate how broad and eclectic the music landscape is today. \",\"user\",[21,22]],[\"s33\",\"d4\",655,985,\"Each artist brought their own unique flavor, and it was thrilling to see how they engaged with the audience in real-time.\\n\\nUser: However, I realized that analyzing music theory wasn't my forte in 2018. As I sat through various classes, I found myself more focused on the emotional aspects of music rather than the technicalities. \",\"user\",[21,22]],[\"s34\",\"d4\",985,1287,\"It became evident that while I loved understanding how music is composed, diving into the intricacies of scales, modes, and harmonic structures just didn't resonate with me. Perhaps it was the way I primarily experienced music— through listening and feeling rather than dissecting the notes on a page. \",\"user\",[21,22]],[\"s35\",\"d4\",1287,1393,\"This realization pushed me to explore other realms in music, where my passion may flourish more naturally.\",\"user\",[21,22]],[\"s43\",\"d5\",105,430,\"User: I explored audio production techniques, but it just didn’t resonate with me, and I found myself tangled in technical details rather than embracing the creativity. I realized that while understanding the mechanics of sound is important, my true passion seems to lie more in experiencing music rather than dissecting it. \",\"user\",[40,41]],[\"s44\",\"d5\",430,749,\"Despite my attempts to immerse myself in the production process, I came to feel it was more of a chore and less of the rewarding experience I had initially anticipated. I think I am more drawn to the emotional aspects of music, like the storytelling elements in lyrics or the feelings evoked by melodies and harmonies. \",\"user\",[40,41]],[\"s45\",\"d5\",749,1006,\"Perhaps, I should focus my energy on areas that allow me to connect with music on a more emotional level.\\n\\nUser: It genuinely feels much better to focus on what truly inspires me, such as creating my own tracks, which bring me immense joy and satisfaction. \",\"user\",[40,41]],[\"s46\",\"d5\",1006,1339,\"This process of creation allows me to express emotions and ideas that words sometimes fail to capture, acting as an outlet for my inner thoughts and feelings. Additionally, I find that crafting my own music provides me with a sense of accomplishment and personal growth, which is invaluable in a world often filled with uncertainty. \",\"user\",[40,41]],[\"s47\",\"d5\",1339,1686,\"Music has a way of resonating with my soul, and every track I create becomes a piece of my identity and a reflection of my experiences. In contrast, when I watched a music documentary, it felt like something was missing, as it didn’t engage me in the way I had hoped, failing to evoke that same deep connection I feel when I compose my own pieces.\",\"user\",[40,41]],[\"s55\",\"d6\",107,484,\"User: This has been great for my personal projects, allowing me to really connect with my roots as I create music. By diving into my heritage, I’ve been able to explore different musical styles that are unique to my background, which has been an incredible journey of self-discovery. I find that these sounds resonate with me on a level that feels both familiar and evocative. \",\"user\",[163]],[\"s56\",\"d6\",484,749,\"It feels empowering to express my identity through music, channeling my personal experiences and family history into my compositions. Each note and rhythm becomes a tribute to the cultures that have shaped me, allowing me to convey stories that matter deeply to me.\",\"user\",[163]]],\"required_parent_versions\":{\"music_history\":{},\"current_constraints\":{},\"goals\":{},\"response\":{\"music_history\":1,\"current_constraints\":1,\"goals\":1}},\"rules_completion_required\":false,\"supported_task_outputs\":{},\"public_output_question\":\"How can I find a more fulfilling way to express my love for music?\",\"public_options\":[\"You might consider exploring different avenues like writing about your musical journey or experimenting with performing live in settings that inspire you. Also, giving yourself the freedom to simply enjoy music without external pressures could rekindle your passion.\",\"Exploring sound engineering might offer a fulfilling way to express your love for music. Like one user who was inspired by a chance meeting with an audio engineer at a festival, you could dive into the world of creating digital music remixes. By blending different influences and styles, you may find inspiration in exploring the nuances of sound capturing and creating unique auditory landscapes that surpass traditional music boundaries.\",\"Collaborating with others who share your musical interests can also be a rewarding path. A user found fulfillment through working with musicians from diverse backgrounds, mixing traditional and electronic elements to expand their creative horizons. Such group efforts can enhance not only your musical explorations but also build lasting relationships, as you contribute unique perspectives to a collective musical vision.\",\"Consider getting involved in music criticism by writing album reviews. As highlighted by a diligent user after attending a workshop, reviews can be instrumental in shaping listener perspectives and enhancing understanding. By delving deeper into the contexts and intentions behind albums, you can enrich your musical experience and articulate your insights, potentially helping others to connect more deeply with the music.\"],\"terminal_expression\":{\"op\":\"var\",\"id\":\"response\"},\"personal_response_selection\":true,\"phase\":\"response_selection\",\"source_documents\":{\"d1\":{\"doc_id\":\"personamem:memory:e7c973803319b0b032a23a834dfe4d7031c42cbaa315dba7d5243d255867dd55\",\"time_metadata\":{\"observed_start\":24.0,\"observed_end\":25.0,\"event_start\":null,\"event_end\":null,\"validity\":\"unknown\",\"time_source\"